:- Dropped PII and preserved unknown fields should be counted in `conversion_audit.json`.\n32:- The module must support `python -m client input.jsonl output.json`, writing converted records to the output path and `conversion_audit.json` next to `client.py`."}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/schema_migration/migration_notes.md"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788212283728}}
